   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A judge's own agent\nreads https://prospect.courses/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json,\nthen calls the MCP endpoint with a read-only bearer: whoami,\nplan_next_steps. The owner tools refuse that bearer by name.",
