   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Stated plainly\nin production the gate is switched off, because the Transparency\nLog runs on a laptop, not a public host. The identities, DNS\nrecords and the MCP call are live; the refusal runs as a script.",
